sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant API as Next.js API / Route Handler
  participant Security as Security Guard (HMAC / Injection Scan)
  participant Router as Query Classifier & Intent Router
  participant Cache as Semantic Cache (768-dim Vector Search)
  participant Retrieval as Hybrid Retriever (Vector + Text + FAQ + Fact)
  participant Temporal as Temporal Governance & Staleness Check
  participant Reranker as Reranker Cascade (External -> Cohere -> Local)
  participant CRAG as CRAG & Evidence Sufficiency Evaluator
  participant Conflict as Conflict Detector & Evidence Gate
  participant Generator as LLM Generator (Groq / Gemini)
  participant Validator as Citation & Claim Validator

  User->>API: Query Request
  API->>Security: Validate Request & Scan Injection
  Security-->>API: Approved
  API->>Router: Classify Query & Intent
  Router-->>API: Query Intent & Risk Class
  API->>Cache: Vector Lookup (semanticCache)
  alt Cache Hit & Compatible
    Cache-->>API: Return Cached Response
    API-->>User: Cached Answer
  else Cache Miss
    API->>Retrieval: Multi-channel Retrieval
    Retrieval-->>API: Candidates (Dense, Lexical, FAQ, Facts)
    API->>Temporal: Hydrate Metadata & Filter Excluded / Stale
    Temporal-->>API: Eligible Candidates
    API->>Reranker: Score Candidates (External/Cohere/Local)
    Reranker-->>API: Reranked Evidence
    API->>CRAG: CRAG Evaluation
    CRAG-->>API: Relevance Scores
    API->>Conflict: Detect Conflicts & Evaluate Sufficiency Gate
    Conflict-->>API: Gated Evidence & Decision
    API->>Generator: Generate Grounded Answer
    Generator-->>API: Raw Generated Text
    API->>Validator: Validate Citations & Claim Grounding
    Validator-->>API: Verified Answer + Citations
    API->>Cache: Publish to Semantic Cache
    API-->>User: Final Verified Answer
  end
